  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A cart of mass 1 kg moving at 4 m s<sup>−1</sup> collides with a stationary cart of mass 3 kg.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>After the collision the carts stick together.</p>\n<p>What is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\textit{kinetic energy after the collision}}{\\textit{kinetic energy before the collision}}\"></span>?<br/><br/></p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{16}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{8}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{4}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{2}\"></span></li></ol>"
